          "body": "Thanks! That's it exactly.  \n  \nShould every screen that supports \"Apply/Prepare as Filter\" include this or would it get too busy.  \nFor example, would it help on `Statistics->Conversations` or just get in the way?  \n  \nIt would be nice if every popup/context menu that has a \"Apply/Prepare as Filter\" displayed the proposed filter at the menu top like is done on Packet List and Packet Details context menus.",
